stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  state "草稿" as Draft
  state "审核中" as Review
  state "待发布" as Ready
  state "已发布" as Published
  state "已归档" as Archived
  state Gate <<choice>>
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Review: 提交审核
  Review --> Gate: 完成审核
  Gate --> Ready: 通过
  Gate --> Draft: 需修改
  Ready --> Published: 发布
  Published --> Review: 内容更新
  Published --> Archived: 下架归档
  Archived --> [*]
